clean and fruitful paths.

00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:15.950
We are...

00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:21.370
the West High student 
council's student monitors!

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:24.930
Did you lose weight?

00:00:24.930 --> 00:00:26.180
No way. You can tell?

00:00:26.180 --> 00:00:28.030
Yeah! What'd you do?

00:00:28.030 --> 00:00:32.360
Well, actually, a guy from the class 
next door told me he liked me!

00:00:32.360 --> 00:00:34.550
That's awesome!

00:00:36.890 --> 00:00:39.860
<i>Internal movie, switch on!</i>

00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:43.830
<i>Record, record...</i>

00:00:43.830 --> 00:00:45.020
<i>Crap! Recording complete!</i>

00:00:45.440 --> 00:00:48.210
You there! Pervert penalty, 50 points!

00:00:48.210 --> 00:00:49.740
Ugh! It's Inoue!

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:51.170
Kyoko!

00:00:51.930 --> 00:00:52.440
Wait!

00:00:52.870 --> 00:00:55.010
I didn't do that on purpose.

00:00:55.830 --> 00:00:57.170
It was just a coincidence.

00:00:57.170 --> 00:01:00.030
I happened to be walking by here, and...

