00:15:23.990 --> 00:15:26.820
Your skirt and socks are cute.

00:15:27.220 --> 00:15:30.080
C-Cute? Th-They're just normal clothes!

00:15:30.080 --> 00:15:32.570
Anyway, where are you looking,
 Shibaki the pervert?

00:15:32.570 --> 00:15:35.200
It's none of your business what I wear!

00:15:35.600 --> 00:15:36.240
Huh?

00:15:36.850 --> 00:15:39.700
What's this? Do you have bad eyesight?

00:15:40.720 --> 00:15:42.730
Inoue, what are you doing?!

00:15:42.730 --> 00:15:44.210
Wow, the prescription matches mine.

00:15:44.790 --> 00:15:49.180
You might actually look a little 
smarter with glasses.

00:15:49.180 --> 00:15:51.980
Huh? I can't get them off. Why not?

00:15:59.570 --> 00:16:01.470
Why are you holding me?!

00:16:02.600 --> 00:16:05.360
I hate mice!

00:16:06.230 --> 00:16:11.220
From my perspective, 
those are glasses of happiness.

00:16:11.220 --> 00:16:12.900
Don't be stupid!

00:16:13.200 --> 00:16:16.120
The misfortune brought by 
magic items is serious business!

00:16:16.120 --> 00:16:18.320
She'll die!

00:16:18.790 --> 00:16:19.950
Damn it!

00:16:19.950 --> 00:16:22.290
Inoue!

00:16:25.840 --> 00:16:26.560
There you are!

00:16:27.250 --> 00:16:28.400
Are you okay?

00:16:28.400 --> 00:16:31.260
I'm not okay. My socks are soaked.

00:16:31.260 --> 00:16:33.690
I'm glad, though.

00:16:33.690 --> 00:16:35.430
<i>Now's my chance to get those glasses off...</i>

00:16:35.760 --> 00:16:36.550
Yoink!

00:16:36.550 --> 00:16:37.680
What do you mean, "yoink"?

00:16:37.940 --> 00:16:39.760
You were trying to take advantage of me

00:16:39.760 --> 00:16:41.850
while I couldn't move, weren't you?

00:16:41.850 --> 00:16:43.810
Someone help!

00:16:44.120 --> 00:16:47.060
You seriously do need help! Inoue!

00:16:47.640 --> 00:16:50.480
No!

00:16:55.440 --> 00:16:56.200
Huh?

00:17:03.200 --> 00:17:04.390
I see...

00:17:04.800 --> 00:17:08.810
All I ever do is punish you...

00:17:08.810 --> 00:17:10.920
It's no wonder you don't like me.

00:17:11.200 --> 00:17:12.880
Oh, sorry.

00:17:12.880 --> 00:17:14.800
I didn't do it on purpose...

00:17:14.800 --> 00:17:18.120
But you didn't have to go this far.

00:17:18.120 --> 00:17:22.520
If you don't like me, just say so!

00:17:22.520 --> 00:17:29.770
Firefighting Water

00:17:23.990 --> 00:17:26.400
You're wrong, Inoue.

00:17:26.400 --> 00:17:28.160
Those glasses...

00:17:28.160 --> 00:17:29.770
Wait, Inoue!

00:17:29.770 --> 00:17:30.840
Stay away!

00:17:30.980 --> 00:17:32.280
Stop, Inoue!

00:17:32.640 --> 00:17:34.940
I'm still a girl, you know...

00:17:34.940 --> 00:17:37.430
Though you may not think of me as one!

00:17:37.430 --> 00:17:38.960
That's not true!

00:17:38.960 --> 00:17:41.640
I've always thought of you as a girl!

00:17:41.640 --> 00:17:42.790
So stop!

00:17:42.790 --> 00:17:44.040
I won't stop!

00:17:42.790 --> 00:17:44.040
Watch for traffic ahead!<b>
Multiple fatal accidents</b>

00:17:44.400 --> 00:17:46.000
Oh, no! Up ahead is...

00:17:47.030 --> 00:17:48.210
Inoue Sumiko!

00:17:48.740 --> 00:17:51.360
Seeing your pink bra through your wet shirt

00:17:51.360 --> 00:17:53.680
makes me feel like I totally got lucky!

00:18:01.040 --> 00:18:02.730
I'm glad I made it.

00:18:02.730 --> 00:18:03.600
You shouldn't be.

00:18:03.600 --> 00:18:04.970
Where are you looking, you pervert?

00:18:06.030 --> 00:18:07.840
There, got 'em.

00:18:07.840 --> 00:18:09.960
Here, take your glasses.

00:18:11.250 --> 00:18:13.120
Why are you so obsessed with those glasses?

00:18:15.310 --> 00:18:16.320
Right in two!

00:18:16.940 --> 00:18:19.200
You'll pay for this tomorrow!

00:18:19.640 --> 00:18:23.970
<i>How can he try to smooth talk me 
by saying he sees me as a girl?</i>

00:18:25.790 --> 00:18:28.410
<i>You're not a girl!</i>

00:18:29.830 --> 00:18:30.860
<i>A girl...</i>

00:18:33.130 --> 00:18:35.380
<b>The Next Day: Monday</b>

00:18:34.220 --> 00:18:37.330
<i>Then the big day came.</i>

00:18:35.380 --> 00:18:37.880
<b>Today

00:18:39.790 --> 00:18:43.610
<i>Club rooms, lockers, the PE storage closet...</i>

00:18:44.030 --> 00:18:46.810
<i>Inoue will look all over the place.</i>

00:18:46.810 --> 00:18:50.770
<b>Hydrant</b>

00:18:47.150 --> 00:18:50.300
<i>But I'd never hide it somewhere so obvious.</i>

00:18:52.230 --> 00:18:53.430
<i>It's here!</i>

00:18:56.150 --> 00:18:58.400
Is this what you're looking for?

00:18:58.780 --> 00:18:59.280
What?

00:19:00.640 --> 00:19:03.240
How long do you think we've been classmates?

00:19:03.660 --> 00:19:05.240
I saw right through this.

00:19:05.240 --> 00:19:06.620
Damn it!

00:19:06.620 --> 00:19:08.360
I'm off to dispose of these.

00:19:08.360 --> 00:19:11.190
W-Wait! Anything but that!

00:19:13.520 --> 00:19:15.190
<i>It's your own fault.</i>

00:19:15.190 --> 00:19:16.920
<i>Because of you, I remembered...</i>

00:19:17.280 --> 00:19:18.790
<i>You're so lucky, Inoue-san.</i>

00:19:18.790 --> 00:19:20.590
<i>No one flips your skirt.</i>

00:19:20.590 --> 00:19:21.740
<i>Yeah, you're lucky.</i>

00:19:21.740 --> 00:19:26.010
<i>But doesn't that mean you don't 
have any feminine appeal?</i>

00:19:28.380 --> 00:19:31.940
<i>I'll burn them along with my memories...</i>

00:19:32.390 --> 00:19:33.900
Wait, Inoue!

00:19:34.210 --> 00:19:36.140
Damn it! At this rate...

00:19:36.140 --> 00:19:38.420
Inoue-san!

00:19:39.120 --> 00:19:41.070
We found some more!

00:19:41.350 --> 00:19:43.350
Look at all the stuff we found!

00:19:41.350 --> 00:19:44.320
Damn it. I can't let them down.

00:19:45.330 --> 00:19:46.990
Magic activate!

00:19:48.910 --> 00:19:51.140
Huh? Where's the trainee?

00:19:51.140 --> 00:19:53.170
She was right there a second ago...

00:19:56.720 --> 00:19:57.960
Did you call?

00:19:58.390 --> 00:19:59.880
Rurumo, I need movement magic—

00:19:59.880 --> 00:20:01.930
Why did you look at my panties?

00:20:02.440 --> 00:20:05.930
If you hadn't looked, 
I wouldn't have remembered.

00:20:05.930 --> 00:20:07.950
Why did you look at my panties?

00:20:09.420 --> 00:20:10.520
Inoue-san?

00:20:11.670 --> 00:20:12.620
Inoue...

00:20:15.050 --> 00:20:17.480
You may not understand...

00:20:21.440 --> 00:20:24.660
but a girl's panties are gentler than the sky.

00:20:28.900 --> 00:20:31.480
<i>Killer flat tornado!</i>

00:20:33.060 --> 00:20:34.310
<i>That's right...</i>

00:20:34.880 --> 00:20:37.880
<i>He's the only one who treated me like a girl...</i>

00:20:40.580 --> 00:20:41.580
The sky?

00:20:41.580 --> 00:20:42.600
Hey!

00:20:42.600 --> 00:20:43.720
I mean, now!

00:20:44.150 --> 00:20:45.340
Okay, Rurumo!

00:20:45.970 --> 00:20:46.830
The sky?

00:20:46.830 --> 00:20:47.980
Hey!

00:20:47.980 --> 00:20:50.120
Forget that! I need movement magic now!

00:20:50.120 --> 00:20:51.040
Got it.

00:20:52.010 --> 00:20:53.060
Damel.

00:20:56.250 --> 00:20:57.020
Huh?

00:20:57.510 --> 00:20:58.600
Where are the books?

00:20:58.600 --> 00:21:00.200
Where did you put them, Shibaki the pervert?

00:21:00.200 --> 00:21:01.150
Who knows?

00:21:01.150 --> 00:21:02.150
Kyoko!

00:21:09.660 --> 00:21:11.620
You saved me, Rurumo.

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:14.330
These injuries are a badge of honor.

00:21:19.000 --> 00:21:21.520
Humans are strange.

00:21:21.520 --> 00:21:23.210
They are pleased to be injured.

00:21:23.870 --> 00:21:25.680
You talkin' about the idiot?

00:21:25.680 --> 00:21:26.930
N-No...

00:21:27.270 --> 00:21:31.380
Anyway, that's spirit world herb tea,
 isn't it? The painkillin' kind.

00:21:31.380 --> 00:21:33.380
Are you not feelin' well?

00:21:34.300 --> 00:21:36.020
I was just out of normal tea.

00:21:37.650 --> 00:21:40.110
I-I don't believe it...

00:21:40.700 --> 00:21:43.070
I forgot to tell her where to move them!

00:21:45.030 --> 00:21:49.990
Stop!

00:23:21.370 --> 00:23:22.630
Huh? Where's Rurumo?

00:23:22.940 --> 00:23:26.250
I sent her out to deliver a community 
bulletin, and she hasn't come back.

00:23:26.250 --> 00:23:29.420
Could she be lost?

00:23:29.420 --> 00:23:32.090
The next episode is "First Errand."

00:23:29.800 --> 00:23:34.970
<b>Next Episode: First Errand</b>

00:23:32.090 --> 00:23:33.320
Leave it to me.

00:23:44.980 --> 00:23:49.990
<b>Watch 
again!</b>

00:23:44.980 --> 00:23:49.990
<b>If you
 don't... 
I'll 
punish 
you.</b>

00:23:44.980 --> 00:23:49.990
<b>It's fun!</b>

00:23:44.980 --> 00:23:49.990
<b>Do I 
look 
good?</b>

00:23:44.980 --> 00:23:49.990
<b>Illustration: Watanabe Wataru</b>
